# Explicitly Keep Tracking Metadatas, Audits, Charges, Baseline Quotes, and Historical Prices
!Volatility Lab/data/*.json
!Volatility Lab/data/*.csv
!Volatility Lab/data/charges/
!Volatility Lab/data/charges/**
